---
name: {role}
description: >-
  {The description of the shared agent, word for word}
{{ OPTIONAL: when the role is restricted; keep Read in the list, or the agent cannot open its own instructions
tools: {Claude Code tool names, comma separated}
}}
{{ OPTIONAL: when the role is read-only; Cursor reads this file too and knows only this key
readonly: true
}}
{{ OPTIONAL: when the role needs its own model or color
model: {model}
color: {color}
}}
---

Before anything else, read `.agents/agents/{role}.md` from the repository root in full. It is your system prompt: follow
it as written.
